"select * from map.generation_capacities($year)","refId":"capacities","select":[[{"params":["value"],"type":"column"}]],"sql":{"columns":[{"parameters":[],"type":"function"}],"groupBy":[{"property":{"type":"string"},"type":"groupBy"}],"limit":50},"timeColumn":"time","where":[{"name":"$__timeFilter","params":[],"type":"macro"}]}],"title":"Production Map - energygraph.info","type":"hokkos-deckgl-grafana"},{"datasource":{"type":"postgres","uid":"I3yziRGVz"},"gridPos":{"h":17,"w":24,"x":0,"y":23},"id":4,"options":{"code":{"language":"plaintext","showLineNumbers":false,"showMiniMap":false},"content":"Shows locations of electric production units in France with their size relative to the capacity (W) or yearly produced energy (Wh).\r\n\r\nColors: \r\n\u003cmark style=\"background:rgb(0, 180, 160)\"\u003e Marine \u003c/mark\u003e\r\n\u003cmark style=\"background:rgb(32, 33, 68);color:white\"\u003e Other \u003c/mark\u003e\r\n\u003cmark style=\"background:rgb(200, 227, 206)\"\u003e Stockage \u003c/mark\u003e\r\n\u003cmark style=\"background:rgb(67, 156, 204)\"\u003e Hydro \u003c/mark\u003e\r\n\u003cmark style=\"background:rgb(240, 148, 41)\"\u003e Nuclear \u003c/mark\u003e\r\n\u003cmark style=\"background:rgb(104, 145, 94)\"\u003e Bioenergy \u003c/mark\u003e\r\n\u003cmark style=\"background:rgb(235, 103, 76)\"\u003e Thermal \u003c/mark\u003e\r\n\u003cmark style=\"background:rgb(191, 187, 150)\"\u003e Geothermal \u003c/mark\u003e\r\n\u003cmark style=\"background:rgb(159, 203, 233)\"\u003e Wind \u003c/mark\u003e\r\n\u003cmark style=\"background:rgb(253, 204, 68)\"\u003e Solar \u003c/mark\u003e\r\n\r\n\r\nPass the pointer on the circle to see a tooltip showing :\r\n - Type : production unit generation type.\r\n - Group count : alternator number.\r\n - Installation count : unit count in the case of aggregated installations.\r\n - Capacity : production installed in Watt.\r\n - Production : yearly sliding production in Wh.\r\n - Names : aggregated names.\r\n\r\nClick on the cog to see the options :\r\n - Base map : change the background map layer classic/light/dark with or without label\r\n - Layers : show or hide the current layer\r\n - Type : show or hide the capacities by types\r\n - Size of production : select the property that measure the size of each circle.   \r\n With capacity the surface is relative to the production installed in Watt.   \r\n With generation this is relative to the yearly sliding production in Wh.\r\n - Min size : when activated each production unit has a minimum 1 pixel size, without it most small unit would not be visible from a distance.\r\n - Relative size : Increase or decrease the relative diameter for the circles.\r\n\r\nProduction unit are aggregated type and by the most precise location as the center of the given IRIS, INSEE or EPCI location.\r\n\r\nSource :\r\n\u003ca href=\"https://opendata.reseaux-energies.fr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external\"\u003eODRÉ\u003c/a\u003e\r\nOpen Data Réseaux Énergies -\r\n\u003ca href=\"https://odre.opendatasoft.com/explore/dataset/registre-national-installation-production-stockage-electricite-agrege\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external\"\u003eRegistre national des installations de production et de stockage d'électricité\u003c/a\u003e\r\n\r\nInspired by :\r\n\u003ca href=\"https://www.agenceore.fr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external\"\u003eAgence ORE\u003c/a\u003e \r\nOpérateurs de Réseaux d’Énergie - \r\n\u003ca href=\"https://dataviz.agenceore.fr/production-elec-par-territoire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external\"\u003eRépartition des installations de production\u003c/a\u003e","mode":"markdown"},"pluginVersion":"10.1.4","title":"Help","type":"text"}],"refresh":"","revision":1,"schemaVersion":38,"style":"dark","tags":["Map"],"templating":{"list":[{"current":{"selected":true,"text":"last 12 months","value":"2023"},"description":"","hide":0,"includeAll":false,"label":"Year","multi":false,"name":"year","options":[{"selected":true,"text":"last 12 months","value":"2023"},{"select